        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I thought I did a good job hiding it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I thought I did a good job hiding it."
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Yes, I'm a bit worried... just a little, though.",
