    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No, I... I know what we're trying to do. I also know... that some sacrifices are inevitable.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No, I... I know what we're trying to do. I also know... that some sacrifices are inevitable."
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But I... what I don't know is...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But I... what I don't know is..."
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Why must I watch people disappear before my eyes one by one... even though they can be saved?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Why must I watch people disappear before my eyes one by one... even though they can be saved?"
