    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Good morning, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Good morning, Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Oh, Dr. Kal'tsit, you're here as well?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Oh, Dr. Kal'tsit, you're here as well?"
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Amiya.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Amiya."
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   I have a rather urgent mission here, and need some people to help out.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "I have a rather urgent mission here, and need some people to help out."
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   An abandoned city was discovered not far from Lungmen.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "An abandoned city was discovered not far from Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   I surmise that it's one of the cities that formed in the aftermath of the Chernobog incident.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "I surmise that it's one of the cities that formed in the aftermath of the Chernobog incident."
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   We'll have to explore that city, uncover more information, and search for any survivors.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "We'll have to explore that city, uncover more information, and search for any survivors."
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   If the situation is particularly serious, for example, if Reunion is hiding there, then there may be serious ramifications on our future operations.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "If the situation is particularly serious, for example, if Reunion is hiding there, then there may be serious ramifications on our future operations."
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Here's the specific proposal that I have in mind. Look over it when you have time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Here's the specific proposal that I have in mind. Look over it when you have time."
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Understood.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Oh, one more thing.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Oh, one more thing."
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Franka submitted a report to me mentioning that they had to return to Blacksteel.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Franka submitted a report to me mentioning that they had to return to Blacksteel."
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   As for the situation in the Lungmen slums, Penguin Logistics requested for you to meet them there to discuss some information.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "As for the situation in the Lungmen slums, Penguin Logistics requested for you to meet them there to discuss some information."
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   There are some more sensitive details, so it'd be best for you to go in person.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "There are some more sensitive details, so it'd be best for you to go in person."
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I know. I'll head over right now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I know. I'll head over right now."
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Doctor, let's go--",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Doctor, let's go--"
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1\", name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   I still have some things to discuss with Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "I still have some things to discuss with Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
