        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Dr. Kal'tsit, you're not allowed to bully Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Dr. Kal'tsit, you're not allowed to bully Dr. {@nickname}."
