        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Forget it, I had a feeling this would happen.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Forget it, I had a feeling this would happen."
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_003_kalts_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Amiya is an incredibly resilient kid.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Amiya is an incredibly resilient kid."
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   But, if she has to force herself to be strong, there will come a day when the pressure breaks her.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "But, if she has to force herself to be strong, there will come a day when the pressure breaks her."
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   Do not let this happen.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "Do not let this happen."
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[name=\"Kal'tsit\"]   If there is a next time, you'd better be a little more useful.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Kal'tsit",
        "content": "If there is a next time, you'd better be a little more useful."
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
